{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-decision-order-letter-to-surrey-council-leaders","content_id":"33c82048-b2ae-464e-a8bd-8fa78b18b886","description":"Letter to Surrey council leaders about the Surrey (Structural Changes) Order 2026.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"69b27f32187a6dea78233264","filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_decision_order_letter_to_Surrey_council_leaders.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":146844,"filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_decision_order_letter_to_Surrey_council_leaders.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9180190","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Local government reorganisation: decision order letter to Surrey council leaders","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69b27f32187a6dea78233264/Local_government_reorganisation_-_decision_order_letter_to_Surrey_council_leaders.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>On 10 March 2026, the Minister of State for Local Government and Homelessness wrote to leaders of Surrey councils about the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukdsi/2026/9780348278507\">Surrey (Structural Changes) Order 2026</a>.</p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>This letter was first published alongside implementation guidance for local government reorganisation. The <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-implementation-guidance\">implementation guidance</a> is now published on another page.</p>\n</div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Updated version of the letter added.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-12T14:03:49Z"},{"note":"Fir